- P. J. Werbos (1990). "Backpropagation through time: what it does and how to do it". *Proceedings of the IEEE* 78(10), 1550–1560. doi:10.1109/5.58337
- P. Baldi and K. Hornik (1989). "Neural networks and principal component analysis: learning from examples without local minima". *Neural Networks* 2(1), 53–58. doi:10.1016/0893-6080(89)90014-2
